# ct4-compaction-retry: CT-4 probe — auto-compaction retry path; ctx.isIdle() === false.
#
# Reproduces the §4 idle/streaming/pending table behavior under auto-compaction.
# The fixture is documentary: the real assertion logic lives in
# `extensions/swarm/ct-phase2-probes.test.mjs` §CT-4, which mocks the pi
# boundary directly and counts R10-1 boundary calls. This fixture exists so
# a future real-lane validation (`pi --provider mock-llm --model
# ct4-compaction-retry`) reproduces the same scripted turn shape end-to-end.
#
# Deterministic: scripted turns + delayMs gates. The probe outcome table is
# printed by the test driver after the lane completes.
